OL,3,ABomb threats target seven flights
OL,4,Aacross Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven passenger planes across Europe,
OL,7,Ftwo of which departed from the UK, have
OL,8,Fbeen inspected following a series of
OL,9,Fsuspected bomb threats.
OL,11,FTwo Ryanair flights, one originating
OL,12,Ffrom Dublin and the other from Lisbon,
OL,13,Fwere searched after landing in Rome
OL,14,Ffollowing anonymous tips but no
OL,15,Fexplosives were found, sources at the
OL,16,Fcity's Fiumicino airport told the BBC.
OL,18,FThe Dublin flight was escorted by the
OL,19,FItalian air force until landing.
OL,21,FAuthorities have also searched planes
OL,22,Fin Poland, Spain and Bulgaria.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
